    "type": "game",
    "name": "Liquid Space Dimension",
    "steam_appid": 2538340,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538340/extras/85425d7d24acdf54bdcd78e597b0b7bf.avif?t=1699452607\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About</h2>Liquid Space Dimension is an arcade shooter inspired by retro classics. Piloting the Star Drifter, you'll use a range of mechanics both familiar and new to get the highest score you can.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538340/extras/60dc9d006b5e534bb5970f50097fbbde.avif?t=1699452607\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>On-Rails Action</strong> - Fly through colorful, low-poly levels and defeat as many enemies as you can.<br></li><li><strong>Free Fly</strong> - Defeat enemies and powerful bosses in all direction while freely maneuvering in all directions.<br></li><li><strong>Unique Mechanics</strong> - Fight with an arsenal of lasers, torpedoes, beams, and short range burst while evading danger with drifts, boost, and rolls.<br></li><li><strong>Classic Mode</strong> - With a limited number of lives, play through 7 back-to-back levels and get the highest cumulative score you can.<br></li><li><strong>Free Play</strong> - Play any level you like with unlimited lives to achieve a new high score.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538340/extras/b9b7d141bb41c83c658f69752e518cca.avif?t=1699452607\" /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538340/extras/85425d7d24acdf54bdcd78e597b0b7bf.avif?t=1699452607\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About</h2>Liquid Space Dimension is an arcade shooter inspired by retro classics. Piloting the Star Drifter, you'll use a range of mechanics both familiar and new to get the highest score you can.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538340/extras/60dc9d006b5e534bb5970f50097fbbde.avif?t=1699452607\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>On-Rails Action</strong> - Fly through colorful, low-poly levels and defeat as many enemies as you can.<br></li><li><strong>Free Fly</strong> - Defeat enemies and powerful bosses in all direction while freely maneuvering in all directions.<br></li><li><strong>Unique Mechanics</strong> - Fight with an arsenal of lasers, torpedoes, beams, and short range burst while evading danger with drifts, boost, and rolls.<br></li><li><strong>Classic Mode</strong> - With a limited number of lives, play through 7 back-to-back levels and get the highest cumulative score you can.<br></li><li><strong>Free Play</strong> - Play any level you like with unlimited lives to achieve a new high score.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538340/extras/b9b7d141bb41c83c658f69752e518cca.avif?t=1699452607\" /></span>",
    "short_description": "Fly and fight through the vibrant universe of Liquid Space Dimension in this retro-inspired action shooter! As Sid Seaburn, pilot of the Star Drifter, master a wide range mechanics like drifting, laser beams, and torpedoes to get the highest score possible and stop the evil general Ra-Baba!",
